        "ggEllCIZG91_text": "<p>Cotton swabs push bacteria deeper into the ear canal instead of removing it. Ear drops add moisture—which bacteria and yeast thrive in. That's why the constant ear scratching continues every day.</p><p><strong>That's why veterinarians developed VetPets EarWipe</strong>s with a<strong> textured surface</strong> that lifts bacteria away and an <strong>antibacterial formula that prevents regrowth</strong>—in a form dogs actually tolerate.</p><p><strong>No harsh chemicals. No struggle. Just a 30-second routine that actually works.</strong></p>"
      }
    },
